A a) Renter Contents – The Property Manager will reimburse the Renter for a maximum of $5,000 in the
aggregate during the Lease Term for the Actual Cash Value of a Renter Contents Liability Loss. Subject to
a $250 deductible.
B b) Renter Premises Legal Liability – The Property Manager will reimburse the Renter for a maximum of
$100,000 in the aggregate during the Lease Term for a Renter Premises Legal Liability Loss. Bodily Injury
is excluded from Renter Premises Legal Liability Loss.
