AT THE HOSPITAL
INFECTION DETECTION: Airborne spread
of tuberculosis, influenza or the common
cold can be controlled by an HVAC system.4
AIRBORNE DISEASE: Infectious particles
can stay airborne for hours and be
transported over long distances.5
HEALTHIER HOSPITAL: High-efficiency
particulate filters are likely to reduce
airborne infectious particles.6
4 https://www.ashrae.org/File%20Library/docLib/About%20Us/PositionDocuments/Airborne-Infectious-Diseases.pdf
