and Owner shall be entitled to exercise all rights and remedies if possesses against Tenant at law or in equity.

6. ADDENDUM SUPERSEDES LEASE, In case of a conflict between the provisions of this Addendum and any other provisions of the
Lease, the provisions of the Addendum shall govern. The LEASE ADDENDUM REGARDING MOLD is incorporated into the lease
executed or renewed between Owner and Tenant.

