(1)All returned checks (regardless of reason for returned item) must be paid with certified funds. In addition
all future rent payments must be certified funds;(2)No smoking inside the property (including
garage);(3)Carpets are to be PROFESSIONALLY steam cleaned at time of move out & receipt provided to
