E. OTHER PROVISIONS
1. The Renter is obligated to immediately inform the Property Manager if any Renter Contents are
recovered or located.
A 2. Upon payment of Renter Contents Liability Loss, the Property Manager is deemed to have been
transferred unencumbered title in the Renter Contents by the Renter.
B 3. If the amount of Renter Premises Legal Liability Loss exceeds the amount indicated in Section A.1.,
as selected by the Renter in the Lease Addendum, and if such excess amount is payable to the Property
Manager, then the Property Manager does not release the Renter from such excess liability.
C 4. The Renter may not assign its rights under the Lease Addendum to any third-party.
D 5. The Lease Addendum does not relieve or release the Renter from all obligations in the Lease
Agreement.
