Tenant to Owner - Buyer Incentive Program
Owning a home can be one of the safest investments you can make, and now is
a great time to buy a home of your own! The SaleWerx team is here to help you
and your family achieve the dream of home ownership through our “Tenant to
Owner” Buyer Incentive Program.
This program offers tenants a Credited Rebate upon
successful purchase of a new home.
Credited Rebate amounts are based upon the sales price of the purchased home.
Purchase Price Credited Rebate Amount
Up to $200,000 $1,000 Credit
$200,001 - $250,000 $1,250 Credit
$251,001 - $300,000 $1,500 Credit
$300,001 - $350,000 $1,750 Credit
$350,000+ $2,000 Credit
EXAMPLE: If a RentWerx tenant purchases a home for $253,000 utilizing the services of a Realtor®
with SaleWerx, the tenant will be eligible to receive a Credited Rebate towards their final closing
costs of $1,500.
To qualify for this program, a RentWerx tenant must be current on all rental payments, agree to
the terms of the TXR Form 1501, Residential Buyer/Tenant Representation Agreement, and abide
by the existing lease agreement.
Credit Repair: Ask us about our credit repair affiliation programs.
Early Termination: We have options for ending a lease agreement early to purchase a home.
Visit www.SaleWerx.com/BuyersProgram to learn more and sign up for this program!
By signing this informational flyer, you are only acknowledging you have been presented this program in writing at
lease signing. To sign up, visit the link listed above.
