6.5. The Policy and this Agreement will be governed by the laws of the state in which the Rental Property
is located, without regard to principles of conflicts of laws. Further, pursuant to any statute of any state,
territory or District of the United States which makes provision then, the Insurer designates the
Superintendent, Commissioner or Director of Insurance or other officer specified for that purpose in the
