Lease Prior to Expiration"". If Tenant does not comply with the ""Agreement for Termination of Lease Prior to Expiration"" , in
accordance with State law, Tenant must pay Landlord the lesser of (a) all of the rent due through the remainder of the lease term
or (b) the amount of rent due up to the day a new tenant moves in and begins to pay rent.
