This Lease Addendum is attached to and becomes a part of the Lease Agreement (“Lease Agreement”) for the Property located at 30
Huckleberry Ct, Villa Rica, GA 30180 between SOF-XII U.S. NRE Holdings, L.P. (“Landlord”) and Alexus Shelby, Brandon Worthington
