damage and legal liability from an A-rated carrier and to maintain such coverage throughout the entire term of
the lease agreement. Tenant is required to furnish Landlord evidence of the required insurance prior to
occupancy, at the time of each lease renewal period, and upon request. To satisfy the insurance requirement,
Tenant may either (1) be automatically enrolled into a policy that satisfies the coverage requirements as part of
